---
// ThreadSanitizer happens-before race timeline: concurrent write-write vs channel/mutex ordering.
const W = 900;
const H = 282;
---
<figure class="gfrdh">
  <div class="gfrdh-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparison showing how ThreadSanitizer detects concurrent unsynchronized access on count++ versus synchronized Happens-Before edges via channel send/receive or Mutex Lock/Unlock.">
      {/* Left panel: Unsynchronized Data Race */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="432" height="254" rx="10" class="gfrdh-card is-red" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gfrdh-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Data race: missing Happens-Before edge (go test -race FAILS)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Data race: thiếu cạnh Happens-Before (-race BẮT NGAY)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="58" width="188" height="72" rx="6" class="gfrdh-box" />
      <text x="44" y="80" class="gfrdh-b">Goroutine G1 (t=1)</text>
      <text x="44" y="99" class="gfrdh-code">count = count + 1</text>
      <text x="44" y="117" class="gfrdh-b-red">WRITE @ 0x..1040</text>

      <rect x="244" y="58" width="186" height="72" rx="6" class="gfrdh-box" />
      <text x="258" y="80" class="gfrdh-b">Goroutine G2 (t=1)</text>
      <text x="258" y="99" class="gfrdh-code">count = count + 1</text>
      <text x="258" y="117" class="gfrdh-b-red">WRITE @ 0x..1040</text>

      <line x1="218" y1="94" x2="244" y2="94" class="gfrdh-bad-edge" />

      <rect x="30" y="146" width="400" height="106" rx="6" class="gfrdh-box" />
      <text x="44" y="168" class="gfrdh-b-red">WARNING: DATA RACE (ThreadSanitizer shadow memory)</text>
      <text x="44" y="188" class="gfrdh-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>G1 and G2 share 0x..1040 with NO sync edge in between.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>G1 và G2 ghi chung địa chỉ 0x..1040 mà thiếu khóa ở giữa.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="208" class="gfrdh-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>On maps, Go crashes immediately: fatal concurrent writes!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nếu là Map: Go crash ngay tức thì (fatal concurrent map write).</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="228" class="gfrdh-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Passes normal `go test` randomly; -race catches it cleanly.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>`go test` thường hay lọt; bật cờ `-race` ghi shadow clock bắt trọn.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right panel: Synchronized Happens-Before edge */}
      <rect x="462" y="14" width="424" height="254" rx="10" class="gfrdh-card" />
      <text x="478" y="42" class="gfrdh-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Safe ordering: Mutex or Channel creates Happens-Before</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. An toàn tuyệt đối: cạnh Happens-Before qua Mutex / Channel</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="478" y="58" width="184" height="72" rx="6" class="gfrdh-box is-ok" />
      <text x="492" y="80" class="gfrdh-b">G1: mu.Lock()</text>
      <text x="492" y="99" class="gfrdh-code">count++; mu.Unlock()</text>
      <text x="492" y="117" class="gfrdh-b-ok">Unlock -&gt; sends vector clock</text>

      <line x1="662" y1="94" x2="690" y2="94" class="gfrdh-ok-edge" />

      <rect x="690" y="58" width="180" height="72" rx="6" class="gfrdh-box is-ok" />
      <text x="704" y="80" class="gfrdh-b">G2: mu.Lock()</text>
      <text x="704" y="99" class="gfrdh-code">count++; mu.Unlock()</text>
      <text x="704" y="117" class="gfrdh-b-ok">Lock -&gt; inherits clock</text>

      <rect x="478" y="146" width="392" height="106" rx="6" class="gfrdh-box is-ok" />
      <text x="492" y="168" class="gfrdh-b-ok">Three Go Memory Model Happens-Before guarantees:</text>
      <text x="492" y="188" class="gfrdh-m">1. mu.Unlock() happens-before subsequent mu.Lock()</text>
      <text x="492" y="208" class="gfrdh-m">2. Channel send (ch &lt;- x) happens-before receive (&lt;-ch)</text>
      <text x="492" y="228" class="gfrdh-m">3. close(ch) happens-before receiving zero value from closed ch</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The -race flag records shadow vector-clock access history per 8-byte word. Any concurrent read/write pair missing a Mutex, atomic, or Channel Happens-Before edge fails loudly with stack traces for both goroutines.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cờ -race theo dõi đồng hồ truy cập cho từng ô nhớ 8 byte. Mọi cặp đọc/ghi cùng lúc thiếu cạnh Happens-Before từ Mutex, Atomic hay Channel đều bị tóm ngay kèm stack trace của cả hai goroutine.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gfrdh { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gfrdh-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gfrdh svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 680px; height: auto; }
  .gfrdh text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gfrdh-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gfrdh-card.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gfrdh-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gfrdh-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gfrdh-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gfrdh-bad-edge { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gfrdh-ok-edge { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); stroke-width: 2; }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gfrdh-ok-edge { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gfrdh-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gfrdh-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gfrdh-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gfrdh-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gfrdh-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gfrdh-code { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 11px; fill: var(--text); }
  .gfrdh-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gfrdh figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
